  "takeaways": [
    "Describe what price did before you name it.",
    "Sweep-like behavior: trades through an area where orders may rest, then fails to sustain beyond it.",
    "A sweep is not a reversal, not an MSS, not an entry, and not proof of manipulation."
  ],
